{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer, all media shown on the current store page is work-in progress footage  and does not reflect the quality of the final game</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the latest updates, check out the official Sand Eaters YouTube channel!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/eba1bc61ec84ffd30f158ab6895ce10c.avif?t=1751059565\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras_big/eba1bc61ec84ffd30f158ab6895ce10c.avif?t=1751059565 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE. DESTROY. EVOLVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a walking arsenal in SAND EATERS, a hybrid genre sci-fi shooter set in a dark future plagued by rapidly evolving nanomachine lifeforms called Hive Golems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/57c07e57414fd4cb1acf3ef16bccd7e7.poster.avif?t=1751059565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/57c07e57414fd4cb1acf3ef16bccd7e7.webm?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/57c07e57414fd4cb1acf3ef16bccd7e7.mp4?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIVING WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your cybernetic body to grant enhanced combat benefits to firepower, mobility, and durability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/e179361c5326e98ffc92d236335aeba7.poster.avif?t=1751059565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/e179361c5326e98ffc92d236335aeba7.webm?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/e179361c5326e98ffc92d236335aeba7.mp4?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLUID COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dynamic combat system giving you extreme mobility and opening new ways to express movement and gunplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/6aec1dbfb6d0d6c748ee53a210ae4df5.poster.avif?t=1751059565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/6aec1dbfb6d0d6c748ee53a210ae4df5.webm?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/6aec1dbfb6d0d6c748ee53a210ae4df5.mp4?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location in Sand Eaters is handcrafted to deliver rich gameplay and visuals, immersing you in dynamic environments filled with intricate details.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/d567e9b3347f4bd82505f82184a59b17.poster.avif?t=1751059565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/d567e9b3347f4bd82505f82184a59b17.webm?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/d567e9b3347f4bd82505f82184a59b17.mp4?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > DEEP LOADOUT CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mech-genre style loadout customization that allows you to forge the perfect arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/a9ebb0c86e4e311cd59380ce6559122b.poster.avif?t=1751059565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/a9ebb0c86e4e311cd59380ce6559122b.webm?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/a9ebb0c86e4e311cd59380ce6559122b.mp4?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVOLVING ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hive Golem lifeforms can re-construct themselves mid-combat capable of evolving into a larger threat. Deal with them swiftly and destroy their cores to reduce them to nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/bdddb15131f89aad5ea092aeb2333de7.poster.avif?t=1751059565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/bdddb15131f89aad5ea092aeb2333de7.webm?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/bdddb15131f89aad5ea092aeb2333de7.mp4?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More coming soon! Wishlist now!</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For regular updates follow Sand Eaters on YouTube and check out the website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game developed by Fiddler Crab Studios<br><br>for business inquiries and questions fill out the contact form on the Sand Eaters website. <br>Thank you!  <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3384370?t=1751059565","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3384370?t=1751059565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/016e06509bc935b033b89bb9184fefc677bffa0b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751059565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/016e06509bc935b033b89bb9184fefc677bffa0b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751059565","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer, all media shown on the current store page is work-in progress footage  and does not reflect the quality of the final game</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the latest updates, check out the official Sand Eaters YouTube channel!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/eba1bc61ec84ffd30f158ab6895ce10c.avif?t=1751059565\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras_big/eba1bc61ec84ffd30f158ab6895ce10c.avif?t=1751059565 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE. DESTROY. EVOLVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a walking arsenal in SAND EATERS, a hybrid genre sci-fi shooter set in a dark future plagued by rapidly evolving nanomachine lifeforms called Hive Golems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/57c07e57414fd4cb1acf3ef16bccd7e7.poster.avif?t=1751059565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/57c07e57414fd4cb1acf3ef16bccd7e7.webm?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/57c07e57414fd4cb1acf3ef16bccd7e7.mp4?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIVING WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your cybernetic body to grant enhanced combat benefits to firepower, mobility, and durability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/e179361c5326e98ffc92d236335aeba7.poster.avif?t=1751059565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/e179361c5326e98ffc92d236335aeba7.webm?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/e179361c5326e98ffc92d236335aeba7.mp4?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLUID COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dynamic combat system giving you extreme mobility and opening new ways to express movement and gunplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/6aec1dbfb6d0d6c748ee53a210ae4df5.poster.avif?t=1751059565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/6aec1dbfb6d0d6c748ee53a210ae4df5.webm?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/6aec1dbfb6d0d6c748ee53a210ae4df5.mp4?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location in Sand Eaters is handcrafted to deliver rich gameplay and visuals, immersing you in dynamic environments filled with intricate details.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/d567e9b3347f4bd82505f82184a59b17.poster.avif?t=1751059565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/d567e9b3347f4bd82505f82184a59b17.webm?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/d567e9b3347f4bd82505f82184a59b17.mp4?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > DEEP LOADOUT CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mech-genre style loadout customization that allows you to forge the perfect arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/a9ebb0c86e4e311cd59380ce6559122b.poster.avif?t=1751059565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/a9ebb0c86e4e311cd59380ce6559122b.webm?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/a9ebb0c86e4e311cd59380ce6559122b.mp4?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVOLVING ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hive Golem lifeforms can re-construct themselves mid-combat capable of evolving into a larger threat. Deal with them swiftly and destroy their cores to reduce them to nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/bdddb15131f89aad5ea092aeb2333de7.poster.avif?t=1751059565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/bdddb15131f89aad5ea092aeb2333de7.webm?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/extras/bdddb15131f89aad5ea092aeb2333de7.mp4?t=1751059565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More coming soon! Wishlist now!</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For regular updates follow Sand Eaters on YouTube and check out the website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game developed by Fiddler Crab Studios<br><br>for business inquiries and questions fill out the contact form on the Sand Eaters website. <br>Thank you!  <br> </p>","developers":["Fiddler Crab Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384370/8e9b8e7fdccfdbc82cd53b559